OL,3,GNEWSAMurder trial set over stone circle
OL,4,Adeath
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder trial date has been set over
OL,7,Fthe death of a man during a summer
OL,8,Fsolstice event in the Peak District.
OL,10,FThe body of Isaac Clare-Watts, 26, from
OL,11,FNottingham, was found in the area of
OL,12,Fthe Nine Ladies Stone Circle in Stanton
OL,13,FLees at 13:38 BST on 22 June.
OL,15,FSzymon Babynko, a 23-year-old Polish
OL,16,Fnational, appeared at Derby Crown Court
OL,17,Fon Monday charged with Clare-Watts's
OL,18,Fmurder.
OL,20,FBabynko, of Commonwealth Way, London,
OL,21,Fwill stand trial at the same court from
OL,22,F8 March 2027.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
